<title>USA: Nautica Enterprises Q2 shr rises to $0.26.</title>
<headline>Nautica Enterprises Q2 shr rises to $0.26.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>(all amounts in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>				 SIX MONTHS ENDED  THREE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>					 AUGUST 31,	 AUGUST 31,</p>
<p>				  1996     1995	  1996	1995</p>
<p> Net sales		$179,481 $142,003    $103,343   $80,554</p>
<p> Gross profit	     81,698   62,152	47,080    35,438</p>
<p> S.G.&amp;A.		    56,583   44,703	29,541    23,186</p>
